zu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div dir="auto" class="css-901oao r-1nf4jbm r-gg6oyi r-ubezar r-16dba41 r-135wba7 r-fdjqy7 r-1xnzce8"><span data-key="fc74aeb8a3f449de915123335577d76e"><span data-offset-key="fc74aeb8a3f449de915123335577d76e:0">Masukkan Maklumat dan pilih currency MYR - Malaysian Ringgit untuk pastikan akaun iklan anda sentiasa menggunakan nilai mata wang Ringgit Malaysia dan terus klik butang Next.</span></span></div></div></div></div><div><div data-key="77f3342065b948bf9343180c07519523" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1mlwlqe r-eqz5dr r-1q142lx r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-xd6kpl r-tskmnb r-1yzf0co r-bnwqim r-417010"><div data-block-content="77f3342065b948bf9343180c07519523" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div dir="auto" class="css-901oao r-1nf4jbm r-gg6oyi r-ubezar r-16dba41 r-135wba7 r-fdjqy7 r-1xnzce8"><span data-key="026cbb15d58e4cc18727ff88259c7c55"><span data-offset-key="026cbb15d58e4cc18727ff88259c7c55:0">Tandakan pada My Business dan klik Create.</span></span></div></div></div></div><div><div data-key="4771ee9168d04a8c8f65c41bf70c84fc" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1mlwlqe r-eqz5dr r-1q142lx r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-1l7z4oj r-95jzfe r-1yzf0co r-bnwqim r-417010"><div data-block-content="4771ee9168d04a8c8f65c41bf70c84fc" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-18u37iz r-1777fci"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div data-slate-void="true" data-key="35bde43be67d4183bf2431c34a072885"><div><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-z2wwpe r-bnwqim">